# This file is a placeholder ONLY — no real values live here.
#
# The backend is the only component that uses secrets, and its template is:
#
#     backend/.env.example
#
# Copy it locally and fill in your own values:
#
#     cd backend && cp .env.example .env
#
# `backend/.env` is git-ignored, and the Flutter app never holds an API key.
# In production, set variables in your hosting dashboard instead of a file.
